*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% ============================================================================
*% HP LaserJet 1022 / 1022n / 1022nw - Native macOS 27 ARM64 Driver PPD (v3.1)
*% Filter: /usr/libexec/cups/filter/rastertozj1022
*% Exakte Hardware-Druckbereiche (12.0 pt = 4.23 mm Rand an allen 4 Kanten)
*% ============================================================================
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "3.1.0"
*LanguageVersion: German
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "HP1022M27.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "HP"
*Product: "(HP LaserJet 1022)"
*ModelName: "HP LaserJet 1022 (macOS 27 ARM64)"
*ShortNickName: "HP LaserJet 1022 (ARM64)"
*NickName: "HP LaserJet 1022 - Native ARM64 Driver v3.1 (macOS 27)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 705"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "18"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsModelNumber: 1022
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 50 rastertozj1022"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Hewlett-Packard;MDL:HP LaserJet 1022;CMD:ZJS,PJL,ACL,PCL;CLS:PRINTER;DES:HP LaserJet 1022;"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Papierformat: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/DIN A4: "<</cupsPageSizeName(A4)/PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</cupsPageSizeName(Letter)/PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</cupsPageSizeName(Legal)/PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<</cupsPageSizeName(Executive)/PageSize[522 756]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Papierbereich: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/DIN A4: "<</cupsPageSizeName(A4)/PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</cupsPageSizeName(Letter)/PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</cupsPageSizeName(Legal)/PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: "<</cupsPageSizeName(Executive)/PageSize[522 756]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/DIN A4: "12.0 12.0 583.0 830.0"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "12.0 12.0 600.0 780.0"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "12.0 12.0 600.0 996.0"
*ImageableArea Executive/Executive: "12.0 12.0 510.0 744.0"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/DIN A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Executive/Executive: "522 756"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Druckaufloesung: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 x 600 dpi (Native Laser Engine): "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsBitsPerPixel 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 0>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1200dpi/1200 dpi (HP FastRes 1200): "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsBitsPerPixel 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *InputSlot/Papiereinzug: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: Auto
*InputSlot Auto/Automatische Auswahl: "<</MediaPosition 7>>setpagedevice"
*InputSlot Main/Hauptkassette (250 Blatt): "<</MediaPosition 1>>setpagedevice"
*InputSlot Manual/Prioritaetseinzug (Einzelblatt): "<</MediaPosition 4>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*OpenUI *EconoMode/Tonersparmodus (EconoMode): Boolean
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *EconoMode
*DefaultEconoMode: False
*EconoMode False/Standard (Maximale Schwaerzung): ""
*EconoMode True/Aktiviert (Bis zu 50% weniger Toner): ""
*CloseUI: *EconoMode

